NOTICE

The MIT license above covers the Python tooling and the documentation in this
repository.

The files under mod/ and maps/ are fan-made derivative data for Command &
Conquer: Yuri's Revenge. The original game, its rules, artwork, audio and map
format are the property of their respective rights holders (Westwood Studios /
Electronic Arts). This repository contains no original artwork, audio, video or
other binary game assets: the mod files are plain-text INI data, and the maps
are INI terrain/trigger data that reference artwork shipped with the game.

These files are provided for non-commercial fan use with a legitimately owned
copy of the game. Do not sell them, and do not redistribute them as if they
were original content.
